_:b71f5268dd07b sh:description "Level of granularity of the trace content, aligned with what the ASAM OSI top-level message types carry: 'object list' for GroundTruth and for the DetectedMovingObject/DetectedStationaryObject lists of SensorData; 'detection list' for the SensorData FeatureData detections; 'raw data' for the unprocessed sensor input of SensorView (radar and lidar Reflection lists, camera image data, ultrasonic). Without 'raw data' a SensorView trace cannot satisfy this mandatory property. See ASAM OSI v3.8.0 osi_sensorview.proto, osi_sensordata.proto and osi_groundtruth.proto, pinned at submodules/asam-openx-standards/submodules/open-simulation-interface."@en ;
